############### payment-service ###############
Base URL: http://localhost:8082

>>> curl -s http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments/clients/1/products
[
  {
    "id": 2,
    "accountNumber": "CRD-TANYA-1",
    "balance": 250.75,
    "productType": "CARD",
    "userId": 1
  },
